    "body": "Adds a shared VI/EN switch and four distinct motion profiles as individual tabs, alongside Original and One line. All six retain independent demo/form state; language changes preserve input, quantities, filters and IDs. English project images are real captures of the demos.\n\nFixes animations stopping after the first scroll pass: persistent observers rearm outside the viewport, editing controls stay stable, and intentional upward scrolling can unlock the hero without resetting data. Focus-induced scrolling does not change the selected demo.\n\nValidation: build and 11 tests pass; 36 style/language/viewport combinations have no horizontal overflow or clipped masks. Browser evidence records project animation runs increasing 1 to 3 and hero progress returning to 0 then advancing to 45 while an updated order remains unchanged. English brief generation and VI/EN input retention were verified. See LANGUAGES-AND-STYLES.md.\n",
